                    enhancements. This approach creates a practical roadmap while keeping the
                    initial MVP focused on the core customer problem.
                </p>

                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Identify features directly connected to the core customer problem.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
