                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Prioritize features based on customer and business impact.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Define future enhancements separately from the initial MVP scope.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

